<metadata><name>RIYC Ladies Cup</name><desc>Providence River race off RIYC (Pawtuxet), from the 2026 Ladies Cup SI section 8. Primary 10.4 NM: G11 south of Conimicut Light, R12, R32, all left to port. Alternate 6.0 NM: G19 north of Conimicut Light, R18, R32, all left to port. The RC may instead signal a variable course on the course board. "Channel" points are routing only, to keep the line in the channel. SI 9 obstacles: leave Sabin Point Dolphins to the east, C1 Pawtuxet Cove to the west, Bullock Point to the east, Conimicut Light to the west; do not enter the RIYC mooring field. Start/finish position is approximate.</desc></metadata>
